WEBVTT

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:10.900
Yugi Muto assembled the Millennium Puzzle and became the guardian of the Shadow Games.

00:00:12.400 --> 00:00:17.260
Pegasus has a Millennium Item of his own - the Millennium Eye.

00:00:17.260 --> 00:00:21.800
Yugi accepts Pegasus's challenge and goes to Duelist Kingdom.

00:00:23.650 --> 00:00:27.800
Pegasus stole his grandfather Sugoroku's soul, and Yugi intends to rescue him.

00:00:28.740 --> 00:00:33.850
He battles alongside his trusted friends and with his other self.

00:00:39.230 --> 00:00:44.300
I can't finish reading the magazine pages

00:00:46.220 --> 00:00:51.210
I get the feeling that I must read it

00:00:53.100 --> 00:00:57.960
Game cartridges are stacked in the corner of the room

00:00:59.920 --> 00:01:04.660
Is there no meaning if I don't play them?

00:01:06.890 --> 00:01:09.760
You're on the other side of the table

00:01:10.210 --> 00:01:13.130
I'm talking to you, but...

00:01:13.730 --> 00:01:20.060
You don't change your facial expression at all

00:01:21.000 --> 00:01:26.310
Even though I'm this close to you

00:01:26.810 --> 00:01:33.580
These feelings don't reach you, don't reach you

00:01:34.000 --> 00:01:40.320
What is truly precious?

00:01:48.030 --> 00:01:51.260
Here we go, Yugi!  We'll determine who's superior!

00:01:51.530 --> 00:01:52.230
Duel!

00:01:58.190 --> 00:02:01.700
I activate the trap card Ancient Lamp!

00:02:06.830 --> 00:02:07.810
What?

00:02:09.280 --> 00:02:13.300
Ancient Lamp reflects the attack back at your monster.

00:02:16.100 --> 00:02:19.180
Kaiba, you trapped me.

00:02:20.400 --> 00:02:24.260
Yugi, I haven't caught you in my real trap yet.

00:02:24.480 --> 00:02:29.460
The most powerful monster is already stirring to life in my hand.

00:02:29.900 --> 00:02:33.560
My goal is to fuse my three Blue-Eyes together!

00:02:41.340 --> 00:02:47.350
Strongest!  Magnificent!
Blue-Eyes Ultimate Dragon

00:02:50.400 --> 00:02:51.660
What's going on?

00:02:51.660 --> 00:02:54.550
Kaiba trapped Yugi.

00:02:54.860 --> 00:02:56.580
He's really good.

00:02:56.580 --> 00:02:57.960
The duel is only getting started!

00:02:58.460 --> 00:03:01.260
Do your best, the other Yugi.

00:03:08.300 --> 00:03:11.040
This match is still in its opening stages.

00:03:11.530 --> 00:03:14.000
It's about to get wild.

00:03:14.300 --> 00:03:17.940
Kaiba, it's time we settle things.

00:03:18.260 --> 00:03:20.680
I will defeat you.

00:03:21.200 --> 00:03:27.120
My equation for victory will be complete when I've drawn all three Blue-Eyes White Dragons.

00:03:27.340 --> 00:03:29.920
My goal is to fuse three Blue-Eyes together.

00:03:30.160 --> 00:03:32.720
Tough!  Invincible!  Powerful!

00:03:33.340 --> 00:03:38.160
Yugi, that equation will yield only one answer.

00:03:38.160 --> 00:03:39.760
Your defeat!

00:03:40.230 --> 00:03:42.130
Here I go!  It's my turn!

00:03:47.500 --> 00:03:50.040
I drew De-Spell.

00:03:50.430 --> 00:03:53.050
I'll add this card on La Jinn.

00:03:55.510 --> 00:03:58.750
I call out La Jinn the Mystical Genie of the Lamp again!

00:04:02.140 --> 00:04:06.040
One spell card on your field is destroyed.

00:04:08.000 --> 00:04:09.090
What?

00:04:18.100 --> 00:04:19.860
I destroyed a nice card.

00:04:20.140 --> 00:04:24.340
Swords of Revealing Light can seal away monsters for three turns.

00:04:24.340 --> 00:04:26.260
It's a troublesome card.

00:04:27.660 --> 00:04:28.940
My turn!

00:04:29.250 --> 00:04:34.500
Is there any way Yugi can defeat that La Jinn-Ancient Lamp combo?

00:04:34.500 --> 00:04:36.320
It's fine.  I'm sure there is!

00:04:37.130 --> 00:04:40.330
Good.  I drew Mystic Box.

00:04:40.840 --> 00:04:44.360
I can now destroy his La Jinn-Ancient Lamp combo.

00:04:45.630 --> 00:04:46.840
Here I go!

00:04:55.020 --> 00:04:57.720
Go ahead and attack La Jinn.

00:04:57.720 --> 00:05:00.550
Make sure you don't fall into another trap.

00:05:00.780 --> 00:05:04.780
I broke your La Jinn-Ancient Lamp combo, Kaiba!

00:05:06.580 --> 00:05:09.490
The spell card The Eye of Truth!

00:05:09.800 --> 00:05:11.720
The Eye of Truth?

00:05:11.930 --> 00:05:16.630
This spell card reveals your entire hand.

00:05:20.320 --> 00:05:21.300
That's...

00:05:21.740 --> 00:05:24.540
He already has one Blue-Eyes in his hand!

00:05:24.760 --> 00:05:30.240
Damn that Kaiba!  He did have a Blue-Eyes hidden in his hand!

00:05:30.480 --> 00:05:32.540
That leaves two more in his deck.

00:05:32.540 --> 00:05:34.720
Three Blue-Eyes?

00:05:34.720 --> 00:05:37.640
No one can beat a deck that powerful.

00:05:37.640 --> 00:05:41.150
Yugi can!  He'll win like always!

00:05:41.660 --> 00:05:45.960
Why won't Kaiba attack with his Blue-Eyes?

00:05:46.400 --> 00:05:49.840
Yugi, how dare you reveal my hand!

00:05:49.840 --> 00:05:51.700
How humiliating!

00:05:52.920 --> 00:05:59.240
In order to fuse my three Blue-Eyes, I must first draw Polymerization.

00:06:00.120 --> 00:06:07.410
I promise to fuse my three Blue-Eyes and humilate you right back.

00:06:07.840 --> 00:06:12.460
I get it.  If I was Kaiba, I would try to fuse my three Blue-Eyes.

00:06:12.460 --> 00:06:16.940
He is definitely trying to fuse his three Blue-Eyes.

00:06:17.320 --> 00:06:21.890
But I don't have anything in my hand right now that can destroy Blue-Eyes.

00:06:22.260 --> 00:06:24.620
I'll have to break Kaiba's combo first.

00:06:25.100 --> 00:06:26.630
Mystic Box!

00:06:35.200 --> 00:06:36.170
What?

00:06:36.260 --> 00:06:40.680
Mystic Box is a spell card that destroys your combo.

00:06:40.680 --> 00:06:44.700
I'll use the first box to sacrifice your Ancient Lamp.

00:06:52.760 --> 00:06:54.530
My Ancient Lamp!

00:06:54.740 --> 00:06:57.200
Come on out, Dark Magician!

00:07:07.220 --> 00:07:08.570
Black Magic!

00:07:11.720 --> 00:07:13.580
La Jinn is destroyed.

00:07:16.080 --> 00:07:17.880
How dare you!

00:07:18.300 --> 00:07:22.050
Kaiba, I won't let you fuse your three Blue-Eyes together!

00:07:22.050 --> 00:07:25.820
I'll drop your life points to 0 before that!

00:07:27.130 --> 00:07:29.700
So you've figured out my plan, Yugi.

00:07:30.200 --> 00:07:32.500
But don't underestimate me, Yugi.

00:07:32.500 --> 00:07:37.200
My equation for victory is more perfect than you can imagine.

00:07:39.080 --> 00:07:43.800
It's already over for you, so I'll just enjoy the game until then.

00:07:44.400 --> 00:07:46.450
Here I go.  It's my turn!

00:07:47.920 --> 00:07:50.280
I'll show you a terrifying combo.

00:07:50.280 --> 00:07:52.950
This is the ultimate killer combo.

00:07:53.360 --> 00:07:56.040
I place Saggi the Dark Clown in defense position.

00:07:56.600 --> 00:07:59.530
I set the other card on the Sub-Card Stage.

00:08:11.460 --> 00:08:13.240
I end my turn.

00:08:13.860 --> 00:08:16.530
Saggi has 1500 defense points.

00:08:16.530 --> 00:08:22.410
I can easily defeat it with Dark Magician, but something feels fishy.

00:08:22.820 --> 00:08:27.100
Yugi, your only option is to attack Saggi.

00:08:27.100 --> 00:08:31.220
I'll keep Saggi on the field until you attack it.

00:08:31.660 --> 00:08:34.230
You're caught in my hellish trap.

00:08:34.660 --> 00:08:35.980
It's my turn!

00:08:39.120 --> 00:08:40.240
This is a good card.

00:08:40.800 --> 00:08:42.560
Gaia the Fierce Knight.

00:08:42.760 --> 00:08:45.800
Gaia defeated Saggi in battle before.

00:08:46.420 --> 00:08:49.010
Okay, I change my main monster!

00:08:49.880 --> 00:08:52.100
I battle using Gaia the Fierce Knight!

00:08:56.220 --> 00:08:57.820
Attack Saggi!

00:09:02.040 --> 00:09:03.480
Spiral Shaver!

00:09:07.260 --> 00:09:09.800
Saggi the Dark Clown is destroyed!

00:09:10.730 --> 00:09:11.960
You fell for it!

00:09:16.830 --> 00:09:17.740
What?

00:09:18.260 --> 00:09:20.060
Gaia the Fierce Knight is...

00:09:21.560 --> 00:09:23.140
It's not just Gaia.

00:09:25.960 --> 00:09:27.660
Dark Magician too.

00:09:27.960 --> 00:09:29.520
What's going on?

00:09:30.830 --> 00:09:32.860
It's due to this card.

00:09:33.130 --> 00:09:35.750
Crush Card Virus.

00:09:35.980 --> 00:09:37.260
What is that?

00:09:37.480 --> 00:09:42.000
I infected Saggi the Dark Clown with a death virus.

00:09:42.000 --> 00:09:47.500
When your monster attacked Saggi, the virus activated.

00:09:47.730 --> 00:09:52.740
Crush Card Virus infects all the cards in your deck.

00:09:54.960 --> 00:09:56.240
Oh no!

00:09:56.700 --> 00:10:03.080
Due to Crush Card Virus's effect, you can't use any monsters with at least 1500 attack points.

00:10:03.080 --> 00:10:06.090
Your deck is as good as destroyed.

00:10:27.740 --> 00:10:28.740
Damn!

00:10:30.430 --> 00:10:36.480
All you can do is wait for defeat.

00:10:36.670 --> 00:10:42.340
Yugi, you're about to feel a duel that will turn your blood into ice.

00:10:43.440 --> 00:10:48.430
Damn that Kaiba!  He's playing crazy cards!

00:10:48.430 --> 00:10:50.960
What's going to happen to Yugi?

00:10:50.960 --> 00:10:56.540
Yugi has no choice but to fight using weak monsters and spell cards.

00:10:56.540 --> 00:11:00.910
But Kaiba has three Blue-Eyes!

00:11:01.760 --> 00:11:02.780
Yugi...

00:11:08.060 --> 00:11:13.740
How scary.  Kaiba plays dirty.

00:11:13.740 --> 00:11:18.740
Since he lost his high Level monsters, Yugi is like a plucked chicken.

00:11:19.120 --> 00:11:24.300
I'll just watch and see how Kaiba finishes him off.

00:11:24.520 --> 00:11:25.900
My turn.

00:11:25.900 --> 00:11:28.800
But neither of us have a monster on our fields.

00:11:29.140 --> 00:11:32.030
Draw a card and set it in your Disk.

00:11:32.030 --> 00:11:35.540
But my monster will crush it in an instant.

00:11:37.450 --> 00:11:41.030
I drew Summoned Skull.

00:11:41.030 --> 00:11:43.980
It has over 1500 attack points.

00:11:45.060 --> 00:11:47.660
Even if I play it, it will be destroyed.

00:11:47.660 --> 00:11:48.690
What's the matter, Yugi?

00:11:49.140 --> 00:11:52.930
I'll keep passing my turn until you draw a card that you can play.

00:11:55.060 --> 00:11:58.840
My only choice is to play Silver Fang in defense position.

00:12:07.100 --> 00:12:11.180
Your deck contains nothing but weak little runts.

00:12:12.820 --> 00:12:15.980
It's my second Blue-Eyes White Dragon.

00:12:16.220 --> 00:12:21.220
Yugi, keep playing your weak monsters in defense position to evade me.

00:12:21.720 --> 00:12:28.260
Meanwhile, I'll gather Polymerization and all three Blue-Eyes White Dragons into my hand.

00:12:28.260 --> 00:12:32.560
I'll fuse my three Blue-Eyes to create the ultimate monster.

00:12:32.920 --> 00:12:38.220
Until that moment, I'll keep Blue-Eyes in my hand.

00:12:42.060 --> 00:12:44.600
Battle Ox in attack position!

00:12:45.380 --> 00:12:47.650
Annihilate Silver Fang!

00:12:51.120 --> 00:12:52.920
Axe Crusher!

00:12:54.640 --> 00:12:56.620
Silver Fang is destroyed.

00:12:58.340 --> 00:13:01.290
Damn!  He's just torturing him!

00:13:01.560 --> 00:13:05.500
The other Yugi has always won.

00:13:05.530 --> 00:13:07.030
There's no way he'll lose now.

00:13:08.800 --> 00:13:12.810
I still have plenty of other high Level monsters.

00:13:13.140 --> 00:13:20.550
But you don't even have the power to survive my Battle Ox.

00:13:20.800 --> 00:13:23.280
Yugi, it's your turn.

00:13:23.660 --> 00:13:24.760
It's no good.

00:13:24.760 --> 00:13:29.520
I don't have any cards that can stand up to Battle Ox, much less Blue-Eyes.

00:13:29.820 --> 00:13:32.040
Play your next card.

00:13:32.230 --> 00:13:36.200
I know it'll be another defensive monster that I'll wipe away.

00:13:36.530 --> 00:13:39.180
All I can do is draw a card.

00:13:39.180 --> 00:13:43.600
I won't give up until my life points reach 0!

00:13:44.280 --> 00:13:45.940
It's Griffore.

00:13:46.360 --> 00:13:49.020
All right!  I can use this card!

00:13:57.350 --> 00:13:58.840
Griffore!

00:14:00.620 --> 00:14:04.760
Griffore?  Another weakling in defense position.

00:14:05.220 --> 00:14:08.260
My Battle Ox will bury it quickly!

00:14:09.600 --> 00:14:13.270
I didn't place Griffore in defense position, Kaiba.

00:14:13.630 --> 00:14:14.600
What?

00:14:15.100 --> 00:14:16.980
Horn of the Unicorn.

00:14:17.160 --> 00:14:19.540
I'll use this card in a combo attack!

00:14:19.960 --> 00:14:21.820
Griffore Arrow!

00:14:26.800 --> 00:14:28.780
Battle Ox is destroyed!

00:14:31.340 --> 00:14:34.120
All right!  You scared yet, Kaiba?

00:14:34.120 --> 00:14:35.290
Yugi!

00:14:35.500 --> 00:14:38.320
Yugi is starting to show his true skills.

00:14:38.320 --> 00:14:39.960
We're counting on you, Yugi!

00:14:41.030 --> 00:14:45.200
I should thank you for destroying my Battle Ox.

00:14:45.660 --> 00:14:49.700
Let's hope this turn didn't cause you to lose.

00:14:51.300 --> 00:14:52.540
My turn!

00:14:53.440 --> 00:14:57.540
Now I have three Blue-Eyes White Dragon cards.

00:14:57.820 --> 00:15:01.050
First, I'll use a spell card in my hand.

00:15:01.900 --> 00:15:04.160
Gift of The Mystical Elf.

00:15:18.120 --> 00:15:23.670
Gift of The Mystical Elf raises my life points by 300.

00:15:24.240 --> 00:15:34.680
Since he had Gift of The Mystical Elf, Kaiba used Battle Ox to get me to play my monster in attack position.

00:15:37.520 --> 00:15:41.400
I'll place one Blue-Eyes on the field this turn.

00:15:41.400 --> 00:15:44.260
It will take one more turn to fuse the three together.

00:15:44.640 --> 00:15:46.940
I finally got you cornered, Yugi!

00:15:49.220 --> 00:15:51.360
Come out, Blue-Eyes!

00:16:02.180 --> 00:16:04.680
Here I go, Yugi!  I hope you're prepared!

00:16:05.200 --> 00:16:07.910
Burst Stream of Destruction!

00:16:28.760 --> 00:16:31.040
Your weakling is destroyed.

00:16:31.280 --> 00:16:33.480
You managed to keep some life points.

00:16:33.480 --> 00:16:35.940
It's your turn!

00:16:41.300 --> 00:16:44.120
Giant Soldier of Stone in defense position!

00:16:44.640 --> 00:16:46.120
I end my turn!

00:16:46.840 --> 00:16:48.360
It's my turn!

00:16:50.760 --> 00:16:56.820
Yugi, since the first time I met you, I've had an insatiable hunger to defeat you.

00:16:56.820 --> 00:16:58.430
I've thirsted for victory.

00:17:00.720 --> 00:17:05.180
I can finally escape from those pains.

00:17:05.180 --> 00:17:08.780
I'll show you how painful those yearnings can be!

00:17:29.540 --> 00:17:32.460
Blue-Eyes Ultimate Dragon!

00:17:32.460 --> 00:17:36.580
This is the fusion of three Blue-Eyes?

00:17:38.720 --> 00:17:41.500
How's that!  Behold, Yugi.

00:17:41.920 --> 00:17:46.680
Witness the splendor of the most powerful ultimate monster!

00:17:46.680 --> 00:17:49.220
He fused three Blue-Eyes together!

00:17:49.220 --> 00:17:51.980
It has 4500 attack points?

00:17:51.980 --> 00:17:53.420
That punk!

00:17:53.560 --> 00:17:57.920
Kaiba was aiming to complete this ultimate dragon all along.

00:18:01.740 --> 00:18:03.560
This match is over.

00:18:03.560 --> 00:18:08.700
No miracle in the world can turn the tables.

00:18:09.020 --> 00:18:11.840
Goddess of victory, I have just one wish.

00:18:11.970 --> 00:18:14.020
Please help Yugi!

00:18:16.440 --> 00:18:23.450
How can I fight against Blue-Eyes Ultimate Dragon and its 4500 attack points?

00:18:23.740 --> 00:18:30.620
I don't have many life points left, and I have nothing in my hand that can stand up to Ultimate Dragon.

00:18:30.840 --> 00:18:33.680
Yugi, I hope you're prepared.

00:18:33.700 --> 00:18:39.400
Defeat was my cross to bear, but I now pass it on to you.

00:18:39.560 --> 00:18:42.640
The weight of humilation will have you down on your knees!

00:18:44.240 --> 00:18:48.160
Here comes Blue-Eyes Ultimate Dragon's attack!

00:18:48.760 --> 00:18:50.820
Ultimate Burst!

00:18:59.480 --> 00:19:01.590
My victory is assured.

00:19:01.800 --> 00:19:03.590
If I don't do something, I'll lose!

00:19:03.800 --> 00:19:06.560
Yugi, it's your turn!

00:19:06.560 --> 00:19:09.880
If you've not giving up, draw your next card.

00:19:14.360 --> 00:19:17.480
Yugi!

00:19:17.480 --> 00:19:18.940
Don't give up!

00:19:18.940 --> 00:19:23.440
The entrance to Pegasus's castle is right in front of our eyes!

00:19:23.680 --> 00:19:27.680
If you give up, that door will remain closed forever!

00:19:34.600 --> 00:19:35.880
Grandpa...

00:19:42.760 --> 00:19:43.960
I...

00:19:43.960 --> 00:19:46.200
I won't give up!

00:19:46.480 --> 00:19:50.320
Good.  Oppose me to the end.

00:19:50.320 --> 00:19:56.640
Yugi, even if you muster up all your strength, I'll crush you easily!

00:19:56.880 --> 00:20:02.080
If I can't survive his next attack, I'll lose.

00:20:02.300 --> 00:20:03.850
This turn will decide everything!

00:20:05.080 --> 00:20:06.190
Yugi.

00:20:06.920 --> 00:20:07.950
Yugi.

00:20:08.690 --> 00:20:09.760
Yugi.

00:20:11.980 --> 00:20:13.540
Yugi!

00:20:16.220 --> 00:20:19.530
No matter what card you draw, it won't help.

00:20:21.450 --> 00:20:25.380
I bet everything on this draw!

00:20:35.920 --> 00:20:40.800
Yugi escapes from a desperate pinch with a Monster Reborn combo attack.

00:20:40.800 --> 00:20:45.080
Now put the pressure on Kaiba's Ultimate Dragon!

00:20:45.080 --> 00:20:49.120
What are you doing, Kaiba?  It's dangerous to step back any further!

00:20:49.120 --> 00:20:54.760
What?  You'll jump off the castle when your life points reach 0?

00:20:54.760 --> 00:20:58.650
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh!:
Kuribohs Multiply!
Shocking Finale

00:20:58.650 --> 00:21:00.600
Duel, standby!

00:21:05.290 --> 00:21:13.690
The flask glistens

00:21:14.730 --> 00:21:21.540
Wait for me in the science classroom

00:21:22.030 --> 00:21:30.510
If we put our cold hands together

00:21:31.210 --> 00:21:38.290
And rub them together, they become warm

00:21:39.990 --> 00:21:44.120
Shower of happiness

00:21:44.410 --> 00:21:48.230
I will shower you with it

00:21:48.560 --> 00:21:56.500
I will support you even when you feel lonely

00:21:56.700 --> 00:22:00.740
Shower of happiness

00:22:01.010 --> 00:22:04.870
You are not alone

00:22:05.250 --> 00:22:11.590
You're protected by a giant ring of friendship
